      "height": 48,
      "text": "$$\\begin{gathered}\\text{record visited states: }\\hat{x}_1^m, \\hat{x}_2^m, \\ldots, \\hat{x}_T^m\\\\\\text{for each scenario }m = 1, \\ldots, M\\end{gathered}$$",
