      "updated": 1770640516722
    },
    {
      "id": "bp-lower-bound-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 385,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 36,
      "text": "$$\\begin{gathered}\\text{compute lower bound:}\\\\\\underline{z}^k = V_1^k(x_0) = c_1^\\top \\hat{x}_1 + \\hat{\\theta}_1\\end{gathered}$$",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "baseline": 30,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 3010079,
      "version": 2,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "containerId": "bp-lower-bound-box",
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "versionNonce": 1496319608,
      "index": "b03",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1770640516722,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "originalText": "compute lower bound:\nz̲ᵏ = V₁ᵏ(x₀) = c₁ᵀx̂₁ + θ̂₁",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.5
    },
    {
      "id": "bp-cut-gen-box",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 82,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 3010080,
      "version": 2,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "bp-cut-gen-text"
        }
      ],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "versionNonce": 378780936,
      "index": "b04",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "updated": 1770640516722
    },
    {
      "id": "bp-cut-gen-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 447,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 68,
      "text": "$$\\begin{gathered}\\text{for each }\\omega{:}\\text{ solve LP, extract }\\pi_t^*(\\omega)\\\\\\beta(\\omega) = W_t^\\top \\pi_t^*(\\omega)\\\\\\alpha(\\omega) = Q_t(\\hat{x}, \\omega) - \\beta(\\omega)^\\top \\hat{x}_{t-1}\\\\\\text{add cut: }\\theta_{t-1} \\geq \\bar{\\alpha} + \\bar{\\beta}^\\top x_{t-1}\\end{gathered}$$",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "baseline": 62,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 3010081,
      "version": 2,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "containerId": "bp-cut-gen-box",
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "versionNonce": 458782584,
      "index": "b05",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1770640516722,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "originalText": "for each ω: solve LP, extract πₜ*(ω)\nβ(ω) = Wₜᵀπₜ*(ω)\nα(ω) = Qₜ(x̂,ω) - β(ω)ᵀx̂_{t-1}\nadd cut: θ_{t-1} ≥ ᾱ + β̄ᵀx_{t-1}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.5454545454545454
    },
    {
      "id": "bp-aggregation-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 261.64764404296875,
      "height": 82,
      "text": "$$\\begin{gathered}\\text{single-cut aggregation:}\\\\\\bar{\\beta} = \\sum_\\omega p(\\omega) \\cdot \\beta(\\omega) \\quad \\bar{\\alpha} = \\sum_\\omega p(\\omega) \\cdot \\alpha(\\omega)\\\\\\text{add to stage }t\\!-\\!1\\text{ problem:}\\\\\\theta_{t-1} \\geq \\bar{\\alpha} + \\bar{\\beta}^\\top x_{t-1}\\\\\\text{(one cut per forward pass, per stage)}\\end{gathered}$$",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "baseline": 76,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 3010082,
      "version": 17,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "versionNonce": 1667931144,
      "index": "b06",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1770641939693,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "single-cut aggregation:\n  β̄ = Σ_ω p(ω) · β(ω)     ᾱ = Σ_ω p(ω) · α(ω)\nadd to stage t-1 problem:\n  θ_{t-1} ≥ ᾱ + β̄ᵀ x_{t-1}\n(one cut per forward pass, per stage)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4909090909090907
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow-bp-to-conv",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 542,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 30,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
